//! `resolve_statement`, `resolve_pattern`, `resolve_expr` (with its frames in
//! `resolve_expr_frame`), `resolve_expr_reference`, and `resolve_class`.
//! `monomorphize`, `byte_capacity`, and `byte_slice_provenance` own the
